# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Two Puresteel Paladins with metalcraft each grant Equipment "equip {0}".
# Forcing: Colossus Hammer, Mox Opal and Mishra's Bauble give metalcraft; the second Paladin resolves from hand.
#   The Plains pay for that Paladin, so the printed equip {8} stays unaffordable and only granted equips are active.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Puresteel Paladin — first copy on the battlefield, second cast from hand.
#   Colossus Hammer — Equipment receiving one granted equip per Paladin; +10/+10 shows the attachment.
#   Grizzly Bears — equip target.
#   Mox Opal, Mishra's Bauble — artifacts for metalcraft.
#   Plains — pay the second Paladin.
# Protocol path: cast, resolution, priority action catalog with one equal granted activation per Paladin.

[metadata]
